<% content_for :meta_title, "Doug Morgen Resume | Fractional CTO and Senior Engineer Experience" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Resume highlights for Doug Morgen: fractional CTO engagements, Rails and Shopify systems, accounting migrations, and operations-heavy software delivery." %>

<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-shell max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Resume</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-700">Senior full-stack engineer and former founder focused on Rails, Shopify-connected products, accounting systems, and high-reliability operations software.</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5">
      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Core Focus</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Rails applications, Shopify and e-commerce operations, internal tools, API integrations, automation, and data workflows.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Engagement Types</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Fractional CTO support, project build-outs, and technical rescue work for teams with urgent execution needs.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Selected Projects</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3 text-slate-700">
          <li><strong>Homebrand:</strong> Rails platform for property document ingestion, OCR/search, cited AI answers, and maintenance workflows.</li>
          <li><strong>ArraFund Commission Platform:</strong> Connected Rails + Shopify system for commission tracking, campaign order ingestion, webhook synchronization, and payout operations.</li>
          <li><strong>BrightGo Accounting Migration:</strong> Hybrid ERP accounting + ops system with ledger migration pipelines, strict idempotency, and penny-perfect reconciliation.</li>
          <li><strong>EasyPost Scale:</strong> Billing and logistics systems supporting billions in shipping volume and high-throughput carrier workflows.</li>
          <li><strong>Cellular Country:</strong> Built and operated an $8M/year e-commerce business with custom inventory, fulfillment, and CRM systems.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <%= link_to "LinkedIn", linkedin_url, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", class: "btn-secondary" %>
      <%= link_to "Contact", start_project_path, class: "btn-primary" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
